", "image": "engenn4le15ob01re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Good morning! How are you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Driver</span>: Very well, thanks! Is the group ready for your trip to Machu Picchu?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yes. Everybody get on, please!", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": "engenn4le15ob01re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: How long is the bus ride? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Driver</span>: Well, weather and traffic permitting, it takes about 5 hours.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I see. How far is it?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Driver</span>: I think it is about 100 kilometers.", "id": 2, "time": "18000", "image": "engenn4le15ob01re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: We are American so we only know the Imperial system.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Driver</span>: Imperial?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: We use miles.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Driver</span>: I think that's about 60 miles.", "id": 3, "time": "30000", "image": "engenn4le15ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Five hours to go 60 miles? Why does it take so long?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Driver</span>: The roads are  twisty here, and the traffic is slow. We have to go up the mountain and through small villages. We go across many bridges. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: How long does the walk up to Machu Picchu take?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Driver</span>: That depends on how fast you climb!", "id": 4, "time": "39000", "image": "engenn4le15ob01re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le15ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le15ob01re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn4le15ob01re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le15ob01re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override":